# Repository Agent Files

rungrad generated repository-scoped agent files for `{{.Tool}}`.

- Skill: `{{.SkillPath}}`

Agents that scan repository skills can discover the skill from the repository root or from a child working directory inside this repository.

Product maintainers should review the generated skill, keep command guidance in sync when CLI behavior changes, and replace generic credential guidance with links to external product authentication documentation.

Provider-specific packaging and runtime files are intentionally absent:

- `.codex-plugin/`
- `.mcp.json`
- Claude plugin files
- hosted-tool descriptors
- remote marketplace metadata

MCP adapters, direct API clients, OAuth, permission policy, hosted integrations, and provider publication remain product-owned work.
